# text = The figure in these two phases haunted the lawyer all night ; and if at any time he dozed over , it was but to see it glide more stealthily through sleeping houses , or move the more swiftly and still the more swiftly , even to dizziness , through wider labyrinths of lamplighted city , and at every street-corner crush a child and leave her screaming .
