# text = The quarrel with Lanyon was incurable Jekyll wrote Utterson was amazed ; the dark influence of Hyde had been withdrawn , the doctor had returned to his old tasks and amities ; a week ago , the prospect had smiled with every promise of a cheerful and an honoured age ; and now in a moment , friendship , and peace of mind , and the whole tenor of his life were wrecked .
