# text = A cry followed ; he reeled , staggered , clutched at the table and held on , staring with injected eyes , gasping with open mouth ; and as I looked there came , I thought , a change -- he seemed to swell -- his face became suddenly black and the features seemed to melt and alter -- and the next moment , I had sprung to my feet and leaped back against the wall , my arm raised to shield me from that prodigy , my mind submerged in terror I screamed , and again and again ; for there before my eyes -- pale and shaken , and half-fainting , and groping before him with his hands , like a man restored from death -- there stood Henry Jekyll !
