# text = Nor can I truly say that I wearied of this beneficent and innocent life ; I think instead that I daily enjoyed it more completely ; but I was still cursed with my duality of purpose ; and as the first edge of my penitence wore off , the lower side of me , so long indulged , so recently chained down , began to growl for licence .
